    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="53">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 53</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif cyrlisc man ætsæce, þonne nemne man him his gelicena ealswa micel wente swa ðam oðrum; gif him þæt berste, þonne gilde he lahsliht: XII ór.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a man of the ceorl class denies it, then as many compurgators of his equals are to be nominated for him as for the others; if that fails, he is then to pay lahslit: 12 ores.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a peasant denies the charge, then just as many witnesses of his same status are to be chosen for him as for the others: if that fails then he is to pay lahslit: twelve ores.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
